# Murder is an instant: Bot1 casts it on Bot2's turn, at Bot2's Memnite, with Black Lotus's {B}{B}{B}. Bot2 answers with Heroic
# Intervention, so the Memnite is indestructible as Murder resolves: "destroy" does nothing to it (CR 701.8a, 702.12b), the
# target is still legal so Murder resolves, and it goes to Bot1's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Murder
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Memnite
Mox Emerald
Heroic Intervention
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Murder.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Heroic Intervention.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Hexproof; Indestructible
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot2.Graveyard = Heroic Intervention
Bot1.Graveyard = Murder; Black Lotus
